Generalized formula:

For setting an attribute to a value:
---------- Client Requests ----------
{
    dev: "", /* Device to change [SERVO/FLEX] */
    req: "SET",
    attr: "", /* Attribute to change */
    val: "" /* Value to set attribute to. */
}
For getting an attribute:
{
    dev: "",        // Device to get attribute from
    req: "GET",     // Method specifying 'GET'
    attr: ""        // Attribute to get
}
---------- Server Responses ----------
In response to 'SET' requests:
{
    dev: "",        // Device which was changed
    attr: "",       // Attribute which was changed
    val: "",        // Value which was/attempted to change
    stat: OK/ERROR  // Status
}
In response to 'GET' requests:
{
    dev: "",
    attr: "",
    val: ""
}
In response to other requests which are invalid:
{
    error: "invalid request",
    details: ""
}

========= ANGLE_STEP =========
    -- Set --
    Request:
{
    dev: "SERVO",
    req: "SET",
    attr: "ANGLE_STEP",
    val: 1
}
    Response:
{
    dev: "SERVO",
    req: "SET",
    attr: "ANGLE_STEP",
    val: 1
    stat: "OK"
}
    -- Get --
    Request:
{
    dev: "SERVO",
    req: "GET",
    attr: "ANGLE_STEP"
}
    Response:
{
    dev: "SERVO",
    attr: "ANGLE_STEP",
    val: 1
}
